<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">BIBLE</book>
  <para style="h">Ebele</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ebe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ebele</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana Bot ɛ Ebele</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana bot ɛ Ebele</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ebele</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Yak ɛ́ mɛkana mɛ nakwyalaa étɛp eYuda nadi edu Klisto ɔ. Mot nakwyal yɛ ɔ, nyɛ ààguaa, sa di tsɛɛtsɛ tɔ tak ɛ́ náá, mot nakwyal yɛ ɔ nɛ gu ekwyala ɛnyɔɛpe etɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ dum nɛ ekwyala binek ɛ́ nyɛ di elyaal etsɛɛtsɛ etɛp nyɛ di ekaada tɔ mɛkana mak ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekeletyɛ mɛkɛn naadyeebatiigaa, mɛtiiga mɛ tak nadi epus náá, bɛ kɛsɔsɔwa. Étɛp tak ɛ, bɛ nakwyal bɛmɛkana étɛp bɛ neepyet, ààbula bhis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Eghɛŋ bɛbhaab, Zɛɛb naagwakel bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda. Nyɛ naalɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá, mot ɛ syem ɔɔ, bɛ go tit étɛp buwa, deenek, Zɛɛb aapel mesyem mɛ. Tin, mɛkana mak lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na bes Zɛɛb sa nɛ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ mɔn'ɛ ɔ, ye ɛ́ Yezu ɛ́ di mɔɔ bhata ɛ Zɛɛb nakaa buwa kɔ ɛsu ɛ mesyem mɛ bot djas ɛ. Bot djas di edum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ, bɛ tokapɛ nɛ gwyes ɛbaaka buwa bɛtit étɛp mesyem mɔɔ. Deenek, ɛbɛŋ ɛ na bes eedhaa yii na mwa. Étɛp náá, sa Yezu Klisto nasa nɛ bot ɛ, yɛ eedhaa yii efofop, yɛ Moiiz, nɛ Alɔn zɛnɔɔ yɛ Zozue nasa ɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mɛtsek mɛ mɛkana mak ɛ dáak:</para>
  <para style="io1">Klisto ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ sa Zɛɛb di ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1.1-3</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yezu eedhaa efofop (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1.4—2.18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yezu eedhaa Moiiz nɛ Zozue (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3.1—4.13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yezu ɛ́ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4.14—7.28</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yezu zyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ di edhaa yii na mwa ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 8:1-9:22">8.1—9.22</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Buwa Yezu ɛ́ ngɔt, ye ɛ́ buwa mɛsik (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 9:23-10:31">9.23—10.31</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛdhiiti eboo bot ɛ nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb sok ɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 11:1-40">11.1-40</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Djhoobaŋaka Yezu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 12:1-13:19">12.1—13.19</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mɛpka mɛ mɛsik nɛ mɛswosel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 13:20-25">13.20-25</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Zɛɛb nalii ɛ́ tɔ nuub mɔn'ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Eghɛŋ namwa, Zɛɛb naalii nɛ bɛbhaab'enaka esok nɛ esok. Nyɛ naalii nɛ nɔɔ membi nɛ membi mɛ elii djas tɔ enuub bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>mos, é mɛlu mɛ mɛsik mena dika mos'aak, nyɛ kalii nɛ nena ɛ́ tɔ nuub mɔn'ɛ. Ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ́ di, mot aalik nɛ esa djas ɔ, dum nɛ nɛ ɛ Zɛɛb nakus gwoo nɛ bɔs. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Ye ɛ́ mɔn tak ɛ́ di mɛkas mɛ duma ɛ Zɛɛb. Ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ́ di elyaal dáa Zɛɛb di ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ di epyet esonok djas nɛ ghwyil mɛkpa mɛ nuub'ɛ. Bhis nyɛ nasilal ɛdis ɛ bot edhuu e mesyem mɔɔ ɛ, nyɛ naazɛnɔɔ nyel di-si pɛ tɔ gwoo, pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, na ghaa mɛbwala. <verse eid="HEB 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Zɛɛb naasa náá, mɔn'ɛ di kɔ elo efofop. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naadjɛ nyɛ boo din ɛ mɛbwala dhaa yii efofop.<verse eid="HEB 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ kɔ elo efofop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Zɛɛb dinaa ààpaake nɛ dhiiti fofop'ɛ ngɔt náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Wɔy ɛ́ mɔn'am, kana dwoo pan mos'ak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">mɛ eebya wɔ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Mɛd 2.7</ref>.</char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Tin, nyɛ ààpakoke-keak nɛ dhiiti fofop náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Mɛ waaboodi nɛ nɛ sɛɛg,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">nyɛ aadi nɛ nam ɛ́ mɔn.»<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Tin, é sok Zɛɛb nadhis mɔn mɛgwyak mɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naake náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">«Efofop ɛ Zɛɛb djas goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛduwal ɛ nyɛ!»<verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Dum nɛ efofop, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb naake náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">«Nyɛ naasa náá, efofop bɛ di tyee epup.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">Tin, nyɛ naasa náá, bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ di tyee ngel du<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Mɛd 104.4</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Tin, dum nɛ mɔn, nyɛ naake náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">«Zɛɛb, boo mɛkoozi mɔ ɛ́ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">Deenek, ye ɛ́ é ɛkɛ tɔ esosoob ɛ wɔ di edjɛɛd ɛyoŋ ɛ lɔ.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Wɔ kwyɛl ɛ́ epiki, da wɔ ɛ́ bhina ɛbiyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg, Zɛɛb'ɔ natɔ́ wɔ étɛp wɔ di mot-mɛsa mɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Nyɛ naso wɔ mul mɛ ebotan kɔ lo ɛ́ étɛp tak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">tɔ sama bɔn ɛ nyoog djas, ye ɛ́ wɔy ɛ́ nyɛ nasɛ́ɛ.»<verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Zɛɛb naabake náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">«É mɛken tɔɔ, ye ɛ́ wɔy Ghɛŋ ɛ nakus bɔs,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">dɔɔ nɛ wɔy ɛ́ nasa gwoo nɛ mɛmbɔ mɔ ɛmet.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Esonok binek djas aadi ɛ́ nɛ ɛsik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:11">ye ɛ́ kabɛ wɔy ɔ, wɔy aadi ɛ́ kɔm-kɔm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:11">Gwoo nɛ bɔs ɛ́ waapulel dáa ekaad.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>Wɔ waabwaada bɛ dáa bɛ di ebwaada kaad ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">deenek, wɔ waakaswoola bɛ ɛ́ dáa bot di eswoola ekaad e nyel ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔ, wɔy ààswoola, tsik'ɔ tok nɛ ɛsik.»<verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Zɛɛb nabɛ ààke nɛ dhiiti fofop'ɛ ngɔt náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">«Dia si pɛ kyee mbɔ eghɛŋ bam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">kɛkum dwoo mɛ aasa náá, bot ɛ mɛbhuka di dáa poba wɔ di ekɛl mɛbɔ mɔ kɔ tak ɛ.»<verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Efofop ɛ́ bɛzɛ? Bɛ tok esisim di esa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb ɔ? Zɛɛb lwom bɛ ɛ́, étɛp bɛ neegheekwyee-kwyee bot aabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Tsik na boo mɛtaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Ye ɛ́ etɛp tak ɛ dinaa, ye goka ɛ́ mena pyetka ɛlyelɛpe tɔ mɛlyo mɛ mena nagwakeka ɛ, é kaab náá, mena ɛzɛkɛwo ze. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Deenek, bhaadal efofop nalɛɛ ɛ́, moo mos ɛ nɛ mɛtaŋ, bot ɛ nasa maa-ɛlɔ, nɛ bot ɛ nadi ààlooba nɛ mɛkpa mɛ tak ɔ naazebela feŋ bɛ di egoka nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Tin, menabɛlka bɛ met, mena aapɛkelka dáa tɔ yak feŋ, yɛ bɛ náá, mena ààbiska boo yak tsik na mɛtaŋ ɔɔ? Etɛɛ náá, Ghɛŋ nyɛ ɛmet nabɛ ɛ́ mot mɛkɛn ɛgoola tsik tak. Bot ɛ nagwak bhaadal tak ɔ, bɛ naabaŋa bis etsɛɛtsɛ e tak. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Zɛɛb nadi elyaal etsɛɛtsɛ e bhaadal tak nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ etseŋa, nɛ endem e mɛbwala, nɛ mɛvyɛkɛlɛ zɛnɔɔ mɛkɛɛ mɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ di edjɛ mot nɛ mot tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛ́ di edjɛɛd bot é ze tsik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb nabɛ ààpadjɛ ghwyil nɛ efofop náá, bɛ di bot aakɔk kɔ bhwak di ezyɛ yenek, yii mena di elii kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak'ak. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Deenek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ dhiiti mot nakaada náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">«Zɛɛb, mot ɛ́ yɛ zɛ, étɛp esiiza bɔ needi kɔ lɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">Mɔn mot ɛ́ yɛ zɛ, étɛp wɔ neekwyɛɛg nyɛ?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Wɔ naasa náá, mot di si efofop ba ɛwala batsa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">Tin, wɔ naadjɛ nyɛ duma nɛ duu<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>wɔ naadjɛ nyɛ ghwyil ɛkɔk kɔ esa ee di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas ɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:5-7">Mɛd 8.5-7</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:27">1Kl 15.27</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:22">Efɛ 1.22</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:21">Fil 3.21</ref>.</char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Yɛ bɛ náá, Zɛɛb naasa náá, nyɛ di kɔk kɔ esa ee di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas ɔɔ, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ náá, ye tok nɛ sa wat Zɛɛb nasa náá, ye nàlooba nɛ nɛ. Deenek, é di mena dik'ak, mena dinaa ààpaabee dáa esonok djas di elooba nɛ nɛ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Nenak yak, Yezu mot nasilaa é ba mɔɔ ɛwala batsa si efofop ɔ, mena kabeeka nyɛ mos ɛ nɛ boo duu nɛ duma kɔ ɛsu ɛ mezuk mɛ ɛsyee nyɛ nagwyɛ é tak ɛ. Tin, kɔ ɛsu ɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb, nyɛ naadhaa é ze ɛsyee étɛp bot djas. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb mot nakus esonok djas di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɔ, naakwyɛl náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bɔn bɛ bela di tɔ duma yɛ. Étɛp tak, ye nagoka ɛ́ náá, nyɛ kwyɛɛg Yezu tɔ mezuk étɛp nyɛ needi mot zedjala nɛ etɛp djas ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, Yezu ɛ́ di mot di egoka nɛ ɛdjɛɛd bɛ pɛ ze tsik.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Etɛɛ náá, Yezu mot di esa náá, bot di dɛɛ ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ di náá, bɛ moo ɛ́ bot ɛ edɛɛ ɔ, bɔɔ djas ɛ bɔn ɛ Sɛɛg ngɔt. Etɛp tak ɛ Yezu di ààdi nɛ syen ɛdjóo bɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bɛ. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>Nyɛ ke ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">«“Iyee” Zɛɛb, mɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛgoola din ɛ lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">mɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛdjeeb kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:23">Mɛd 22.23</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Yezu eebaazɛke náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">«Mɛ aawa ɛbwaalel ɛ lam nɛ Zɛɛb»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Nyɛ eebaazɛbil náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">«Beea mɛ, mɛ ɛ́ bis nɛ bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ mɛ ɔ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Eza 8.17-18</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Deenek, dáa ye di náá, bɔn tak nabyel ɛ, byela epuud nɛ ghiya ɛ, Yezu nyɛy pe nadi ɛ́ nyɛ moo dáa bɔɔ. Etɛp tak ɛ di náá, kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛsyee ɛ lɛ, nyɛ naakwak dim mot mɛkɔŋ. Dim mot mɛkɔŋ, mot nadi nɛ eghɛŋ kɔ esyee ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>É di'enek, nyɛ naazɛpɛk bot tɔ bwoo ɛsyee nazemɛt bɛ dáa ekwom membu nɛ mesee ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Etɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ etɛp ɛzɛkwyee efofop. Nyɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ etɛp ɛkwyee bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ Abalaam. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Etɛp tak ɛ Zɛɛb nasa náá, nyɛ di tyee wat nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg, etɛp nyɛ needi boo Ghaa-Zɛɛb'ɔɔ na mbɛɛ lyem nɛ esosoob tɔ mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb. Étɛp Zɛɛb neepel mesyem mɛ bot ɛ bɔs djas. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>É di'enek, dáa ye di náá, é sok nyɛ nawaa tɔ mɛbhowal ɛ, nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet naabee mezuk ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil kakwyee bot ɛ di tɔ mezuk.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Duu ɛ Yezu eedhaa yɛ Moiiz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, biyɔ bot ɛ na dɛɛ, biyɔ bot ɛ di tɔ sama nɛ bot ɛ nabela ndjóoel nadus pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ. Tin guka náá, Yezu ɛ́ mot-lwoma ɛ Zɛɛb dɔɔ nɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɛdum ɛ koŋ mena di egoolaka ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ sosoob é mis mɛ Zɛɛb mot nadjɛ nyɛ boo ekukuma, dáa Moiiz kɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ djas ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Tin, Yezu goka ɛ́ nɛ djɛaa duma dhaa duma di edjɛaa nɛ Moiiz ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mot di sum ndjaŋ ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ duu dhaa ndjaa tak. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Mendjaa djas, mot ɛ di esum yɛ, ghuna, Zɛɛb ɛ́ di mot di esum esonok djas ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Yɛ kabɛ Moiiz ɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ sosoob tɔ ndjaa Zɛɛb. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mot-mɛsa di egoola etɛp e Zɛɛb nadi elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Tin, Klisto ɛ́ sosoob dáa mɔn di náá, sɛɛg naadjɛ nyɛ ekukuma ɛdjɛɛd ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔ. Bela náá, ndjaŋ'ɛ tak ɛ́ menabɛlka yɛ bɛ náá, mena ɛpebaalka ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ɛbwaalel mena dika nɛ mɛmyaala kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛɛb ɛpedjɛ ɛwala nɛ bot ɛ di elooba nɛ nɛ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Ye ɛ́ etɛp tak ɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ di elɛɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">«Bi ɛ́ gwak gwood ɛ Zɛɛb mos ɔɔ,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>sa bi ààlyel elyem, dáa bi nasa é ghɛŋ bi nakus ɛghuub nɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">dwoo bi nawa nyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal pɛ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Zɛɛb ke ɛ́ náá: penek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bɛbhaab bin naawa mɛ tɔ mɛbhowal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:9">ye nakoozodi bhis bɛ nazebee esesa ee mɛ nasa ɛ́ djas<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>tɔ membu mɛkam-mɛná.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">Ye ɛ́ dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ mɛ nabiyo nɛ bot binɔk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">bhii tak, mɛ eezɛke náá: “Elyem bɔɔ zodi ɛ́ pila mɛlu djas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">bɛ dinaa ààpaatiibal sa mɛ di egwaal nɛ nɔɔ ɛ.”<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Tɔ mɛbuk mam, mɛ naatuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">bɛ aanàkwaani tɔ sum dik mɛ nazekoobal étɛp bɛ neezɛwala ɛ!»<verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, dika ndjem. Sa dhiiti mot pak'en ààdi nɛ mbee lyem di esa náá, nyɛ nàdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, sa nyɛ ààlum Zɛɛb mot di nɛ tsik ɔ koŋ. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Dáa mena di ezyɛka nɛ ɛke dáa ekwyala di elɛɛ náá, «dwoo ɛlak mos», djɛelka mɛghaaz pak'en mɛlu djas, é kaab náá, mot ngɔt pak'en ɛzɛkɛbula sik tɔ mesyem. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Tin, menaka ɛ́ bot ɛ di egyee sama nɛ Klisto ɔ. Yɛ bɛ náá, mena ɛpebaalka ɛbwaalel mena dika nɛ yɛ nɛ Klisto dáa bot nakɛkan ɛ ààwak é ze. <verse eid="HEB 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">«Mos, bi ɛ́ gwak gwood ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, sa bi ààlyel elyem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">dáa bi nasa é ghɛŋ bi nakus ɛghuub nɛ nɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Ye nabɛ bɛzɛ nagwak gwood ɛ Zɛɛb da bɛ ɛ́ kus ɛghuub nɛ nɛ? Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bot djas ee Moiiz nawyisal pɛ kɔ dɛl Eziptɛ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Tin, Zɛɛb nalyaal ɛbuk ɛ lɛ nɛ bɛzɛ edi membu mɛkam-mɛná? Nyɛ nalyaal ɛbuk ɛ lɛ ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ nasyem ɔ, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛbela ɛsyee, gwyɛ kɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Eghɛŋ Zɛɛb natuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ náá: «Bɛ aanàkwaani tɔ sum dik mɛ nazekoobal bɛ yɛ ɛ étɛp bɛ neezɛwala ɛ.» Tin, nyɛ nalii deenek nɛ bɛzɛ? Nyɛ nalii ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ nakus ɛghuub nɛ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Deenek, mena naabee nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààni tɔ sum dik ɛwala, etɛɛ náá, bɛ naabyen ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Zɛɛb naakɛk mena náá, mena waabelaka ɛwala nyɛ nazekoobal étɛp'ena ɛ. Mena ɛ́ koobakaka, sa mot pak'enaka ààsu ɛni tɔ ɛwala ɛlenek. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Etɛɛ náá, mena naagwak Mbɛɛ Bhaadal dáa bot ɛ nadi tɔ kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ. Tin, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal bɛ nagwak ɛ́, nabɛ ɛ ààsa bɛ sonok etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààwa ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ sa bɛ nagwak ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Menabɛlka bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, mena waanika tɔ ɛwala Zɛɛb nakɛk náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">«Myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ mɛ natuwal tɔ ɛbuk ɛ lam ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">bɛ aanàbooni tɔ sum dik mɛ nazekoobal bɛ étɛp ɛkɛwala ɛ.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Nyɛ nakake deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezesilal mɛsa mɛ é sok nyɛ nakus bhwak ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>É di'enek, ekwyala lɛɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛlu ɛ etɛn nɛ ebá ɛ́ náá: «Zɛɛb naazɛwala é ɛlu ɛ etɛn nɛ ebá é mɛsa mɛ djas nyɛ nadi esa ɛ.» <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Zɛɛb nabaake tɔ ekwyala binek ɛ́ náá: «Bɛ aanàbooni tɔ sum dik mɛ nazekoobal bɛ étɛp bɛ neekɛwala ɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Mɛd 95.11</ref>.</char></note>.» <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Bot ɛ nanyɛl ɛgwak Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɔɔ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààni tɔ ɛwala Zɛɛb nakɛk ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààlooba. É di'enek, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nɛ ghwyil ni yɔbɔ tɔ ɛwala ɛlenek. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ Zɛɛb baadjɛ dhiiti ɛlu, nyɛ djóo ɛlu ɛ tak ɛ́ «mos». Nyɛ naaloozelɛɛ tɔ nuub ɛ Dhavid náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">«Bi ɛ́ gwak gwood ɛ Zɛɛb mos ɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">sa bi ààlyel elyem<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Mɛd 95.7-8</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, Zozuwe naadjɛɛd bɔn Yisalaɛl étɛp ɛkɛniigal bɛ tɔ sum dik e ɛwala Zɛɛb ɔɔ, pe Zɛɛb ààpalii kɔ ɛsu ɛ dhiiti ɛlu. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ pe ɛ nɛ dhiiti ɛwala étɛp bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb. Ɛwala tak nɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ ɛwala ɛlu ɛ etɛn nɛ ebá. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Etɛɛ náá, mot aani tɔ ɛwala ɛ Zɛɛb nazekoobal ɔ, nyɛ waawala tɔ mɛsa mɛ dáa Zɛɛb nawala tɔ yɛ mɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Djhoosaka mɛghaaz étɛp ɛni tɔ ɛwala tak, etɛɛ náá, mot ngɔt needi ààwo ze étɛp ɛbaŋa mɛsa mɛ bɛbhaab bena bot nabyen ɛlooba ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Mɛpka mɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ tsik, ye ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil. Ye nɛ wol dhaa pɛl. Mɛpka mɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ni tɔ ɛsuk ɛ elyem, tɔ mɛtii mɛ nyel, kɛkum tɔ mɛsyel mɛ egwyes. Ye nɛ pɛ́ɛ mɛkwosak nɛ esiiza elyem. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Ye tok nɛ sa di sɔ é mis mɛ Zɛɛb. Esonok djas nyɛ nasa ɛ́ popoopwon é mis mɛ. Mis mɛ nɛ bee etɛp djas. Ye ɛ́ pɛ daa lɛ ɛ mena aabookɛtaŋalka.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛ́ boo ghaa Zɛɛb na lyem ghoŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Dhjoopyetka ghiŋ tɔ ɛdum ɛkoŋ nɛ Zɛɛb mena di egoolaka ɛ! Etɛɛ náá, menaka ɛ́ nɛ boo ghaa Zɛɛb mot mɛbwala nakɛkum pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɔ: Ye ɛ́ Yezu, mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Boo ghaa Zɛɛb yena ɛ́ nɛ mezuk tɔ lyem é ghɛŋ nyɛ di ebee mena tɔ mezuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ etɛp di edhaa mena ghwyil ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naawaa tɔ mɛbhowal mɛ etɛp djas dáa menabɛlka. Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkosyem. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Djhootiilaka nɛ ɛbwaalel djas e bhaaz boo ekukuma Zɛɛb, pɛ kyee ye di nɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ɛ. Pɛ daa lɛ, mena ɛpebelaka ɛpelak nɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ, étɛp nyɛ neekwyee mena é tɛtɛ ɛwala.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Ghaa-Zɛɛb djas sɛ́ɛaa ɛ́ pak bot, mɛsa mɛ ɛ́ ɛsa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb étɛp bot. Nyɛ djɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ esa ɛgwyena nɛ ɛka buwa étɛp mesyem. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdi nɛ lyem ghoŋ nɛ bot ɛ di ààgu sonok ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ di esa mesyem ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛmet ɛ mot, ye ɛ́ nɛ esa ee di dhaa nyɛ ghwyil ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>Dáa ye di náá, ye ɛ́ nɛ esa ee di edhaa nyɛ ghwyil ɛ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛka buwa étɛp ɛpelak ɛ mesyem mɛ bot, dɔɔ nɛ ɛpelak ɛ mesyem mɛ met. <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Mot tok nɛ ghwyil dja djem náá, mɛ moo ɛ́ ghaa-Zɛɛb. Ye ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ di esa náá, mot di ghaa-Zɛɛb, dáa nyɛ nasa nɛ Alɔn ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Ye ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ Klisto, ye tok nyɛy ɛmet nasa náá, nyɛ di boo ghaa-Zɛɛb. Nyɛ nabela di boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ Zɛɛb mot nake nɛ nɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">«Wɔy ɛ́ mɔn'am,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">kana dwoo pan mos'ak, mɛ eebya wɔ.»<verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>Zɛɛb nabaake ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">«Wɔ ɛ́ ghaa-Zɛɛb na kɔm-kɔm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">tyee wat nɛ Mɛlkisedɛk.»<verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>É sok Yezu nadi kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ, nyɛ nadi edjaala, dɔɔ nɛ ɛwaab ɛ ghoŋ pɛ daa Zɛɛb tɔ ekim, nɛ miŋal é mis. Nyɛ nadi edjaala deenek ɛ nɛ Zɛɛb mot nagoka nɛ ɛtsik nyɛ tɔ ɛsyee ɔ. Tin, Zɛɛb naagwak mendjaala mɛ etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ ɛlooba nɛ etɛp djas. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Ye nakoozodi náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ naadjek ɛlooba nɛ Zɛɛb tɔ mezuk mɛ djas nyɛ naboma nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Zɛɛb naasa náá, nyɛ di mot zedjala ɔ. Tin, bot djas di elooba nɛ Klisto ɔ, bɛ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Deenek, Zɛɛb eedjɛ nyɛ di boo ghaa-Zɛɛb tyee wat nɛ Mɛlkisedɛk.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛdi ɛ́ ghiŋ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Bis ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ etɛp ɛlii dum nɛ tɛp'ak. Sa di esa ɛ́, ye ɛ́ náá, ye nɛ kɔɔla é ɛbɔɔd ɛ tɛp tak ɛnyɔɛpe. Etɛɛ náá, bi ààkawa zii é ɛmɛt ɛsuk etɛp. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Ye moo ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛlu di esiŋaa náá, bi di bɛlyoel ɛ. Deenek, bi dinaa nɛ gwyes náá, bɛ baalyo bin ba mɛlyo mɛ mɛkɛn e mɛpka mɛ Zɛɛb. Bi dinaa nɛ gwyes ɛdɛ mɛdii mɛ mɛbel, ààbɛ edee bot ɛ di nɛ mɛdjɛ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Mot zodi náá, nyɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ ɛdedɛ mɛdii mɛbel ɔ, ye ɛ́ mɔn tɔlɔɔ. Nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsuu mɛso é etɛp di náá, ye ɛ́ epiki ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Tin, edee bot ɛ di nɛ mɛdjɛ ɔ, ye ɛ́ edee yii eboo bot. Tɔ mɛsa mɔɔ, bɛ eezegu ɛbiyo nɛ ɛnyɔ.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Deenek, mena goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdu ɛ mɛlyo mɛ di egoka nɛ bot ɛ zewyee ɔ, ààkabɛ náá, mena baasikeka pɛ mɛlyo mɛ mɛkɛn dum nɛ Klisto. Sa mena ààbaasikeka tɔ ɛsuk ɛ mɛ mɛlyo mɛ mɛkɛn mɛ di elii dum nɛ: Ɛkat esesɛɛ di edul bot tɔ ɛsyee ɛ, nɛ mɛlyo mɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ zɛɛb, <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>mɛlyo dum nɛ ɛduwa Zɛɛb, ɛkɛl ɛ bot mɛmbɔ é mendjaala, nɛ mɛlyo dum nɛ ɛgom bot bhis ɛsyee, zɛnɔɔ mɛlyo dum nɛ epɛ́ɛ na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Zɛɛb ɛ́ kwyɛl ɔɔ, bot ɛ waadjɛ mɛlyo mɛ di egoka nɛ bot ɛ zewyee ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Djhoonɔɔka geka nɛ bot ɛ nabula pɛ bhis tɔ mbi tsik bɛ nadi nɛ yɛ sok ɛ: Bɛ naabela mɛkas ɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ naabowal ɛkɛɛ nadus tɔ gwoo ɛ, bɛ naabela Sisim na Dɛɛ, <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>bɛ naakwyɛl mbɛɛ mɛpka ɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ naagu ghwyil mɛbwala mɛ bhwak aazyɛ ɛ, <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>bela náá, bɛ naabaabula sik tɔ tsik'ɔɔ na mwa. Bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbaaswoolaa tsik'ɔɔ swola sis. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ ɛpebaabem mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb mbema sis é mɛlaaba. Bɛ ɛpedjɛs bɛdhiiti bot náá, bɛ lee nyɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Djhoopokonɔɔka kana bɔs: Eghɛŋ bɛbhi di enee ɛ, bɔs nɛ min mɛdii mɛ tak, ye ɛ́ di esa náá, mbɛɛ eka kwyil, ɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di ebɛ epyeeb ɔ. Deenek, Zɛɛb eesɛ́ɛ mɛtel kɔ bɔs tak. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Tin, bɔs tak ɛwyisal mɛkpak mɛ mɛgɔk nɛ engwyinini ɔɔ, yɛ ààval dhiiti sonok. Deenek, Zɛɛb aanàbɔya nɛ ɛkal ɛ yɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ dikaa.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, ye ɛ́ bɛ náá bis ɛpelii deenek ɔɔ, bis ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, bi ɛ́ tɔ tɛtɛ ze di edjɛ tsik ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Zɛɛb ɛ́ mot di piki ɔ. Nyɛ aanàdjisa mbɛɛ mɛsa mɛ bi di esa ɛ, ààkobɛ-bɛak kwyɛl bi di nɛ yɛ nɛ nɛ ɛ. Bi nalyaal kwyɛl tak ɛ́ tɔ mbɛɛ mɛsa mɛ bi nadi esesa nɛ yii bi di esa nenak nɛ bɛdhiiti ekeletyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Tin, bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, mot nɛ mot pak'en wa zii kɛkum dwoo mɛsik. Etɛɛ náá, ɛbwaalel ɛ len neesael ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Sa bi ààdi bɛsikel ɛ bot. Tin, nɔɔka geka bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ zii djas ɔ. Bot di náá bɛ waaboobela ekɛk e Zɛɛb ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ekɛk e Zɛɛb ààswoola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Eghɛŋ Zɛɛb nakɛk Abalaam ɛ, nyɛ naatuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ nɛ din ɛ lɛ met. Etɛɛ náá, ye tok nɛ mot di nɛ mɛbwala dhaa nyɛy étɛp nyɛ neetuwal ɛ din ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>Nyɛ naake náá: «Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ aasɛ́ɛ wɔ mɛtel, mɛ aasa náá, wɔ di nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bɛdha.»<verse eid="HEB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Abalaam naabɔya tɔ bhwood, nyɛ naabalabela sa Zɛɛb nakɛk nyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Eghɛŋ bot di etuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ ɛ, bɛ sa yɛ ɛ nɛ din ɛ mot di eval dhaa bɔɔ ɔ. Deenek ɛtuwal ɛ myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ menek lyaal ɛ etsɛɛtsɛ mot di etuwal yɛ ɔ, nɛ ɛbaasa náá, mɛso si. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Ghuna Zɛɛb nakwyɛl ɛ́, ɛlyaal popoopwon nɛ bot ɛ di ebwood ekɛk ɔ náá, mɛpka mɛ ààswoola, étɛp tak ɛ di náá, nyɛ naatuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ ekɛk binek. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Ekɛk nɛ ɛtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ ɛ́ esonok ebá ee bot di ààswoola ɛ. Tɔ ekɛk bɛ, nɛ tɔ ɛtuwal ɛ myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ, Zɛɛb tok nɛ ghwyil ɛkɔɔ. Deenek, bisɔ bot ɛ zebet esonok djas étɛp ɛdi ɛ sama nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, ye ɛpedjɛ bis mɛghaaz náá, bis di nɛ boo ɛbwaalel étɛp ɛbela sa nyɛ nakɛk bis ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Ɛbwaalel ɛ tak ɛ́ nɛ nes ɛ́ dáa mbwak mɛsuwa étɛp tsik'es. Ye ɛ́ sa mɛlyel nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, yii di edhaa kɛni pɛ tɔ boo kaad di ekaa mɛdhɛŋ mɛ ndjaa mendjaala di tɔ gwoo ɛ, kɛkum di na dɛɛ di tɔ tak ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>Ye ɛ́ tin ɛ, Yezu nadi mot mɛkɛn é ɛni tɔ tak ɛsok nɛ nes kɔ ɛsu ɛ les. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ moo ɛ́ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb kɔm-kɔm tyee wat nɛ Mɛlkisedɛk.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛlkisedɛk ɛ mɛkoozi nɛ baadi ghaa-Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Mɛlkisedɛk yenɔk nabɛ ɛ́ mɛkoozi mɛ kyee dik Salɛm, nyɛ nabaadi ɛ́ ghaa-Zɛɛb Zɛɛb na vyɛɛgvyɛɛg. Eghɛŋ, Abalaam nabula kɛduu dɛɛb ee nyɛ nakwak bɛmɛkoozi ɛ, Mɛlkisedɛk naatɔ́ kɛboma nɛ nɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ nasɛɛ Abalaam mɛtel. <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>Abalaam naadjɛ nyɛ edyaal kam esa ee nyɛ nabela ɛ. Guka náá, din ɛ Mɛlkisedɛk kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́: «Mɛkoozi mɛ epiki». Baabela náá, Mɛlkisedek ɛ́ mɛkoozi mɛ kyee dik Salɛm, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́: «Mɛkoozi mɛ egwyem». <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Nyɛ tok nɛ dhaad mɛbyel. Bot ààgu ɛbyel ɛ lɛ nɛ ɛsyee ɛ lɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ tyee mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ ɛ́ ghaa-Zɛɛb kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Beeka, Mɛlkisedek nadi ɛ́ boo kuma mot, bhaab'enaka Abalaam naadjɛ edyaal kam esa ee nyɛ nabela é dɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Etsi ɛ Moiiz lɛɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ Levi ɛ́ náá: ye egoka bɛ nɔɔ edyaal kam esa e bot ɛ membyak mɛ bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl djas. Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, bɛ nɔɔ edyaal kam tak nɛ bɔn bɛnyɛɛg bɔɔ met, bɔn bɛnyɛɛg bɔɔ tak ɛ pe ɛ́ bɛdha ɛ Abalaam. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Mɛlkisedek nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ dha ɛ Levi. Tin, nyɛ naanɔɔ edyaal kam kɔ esa Abalaam nabula nɛ yɛ é dɛɛb ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ naasɛɛ Abalaam mot nabela ekɛk e Zɛɛb ɔ mɛtel. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Tin, mot di esɛɛ mot mɛtel ɔ, nyɛ eedhaa mot bɛ di esɛɛ nyɛ mɛtel ɔ, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsuu mɛso kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Bɛdha ɛ Levi, bot ɛ di enɔɔ edyaal kam kɔ esa e bot ɔ, bɛ ɛ́ bot di náá, bɛ waagwyɛ djɛmɛn. Tin, Mɛlkisedek mot nanɔɔ edyaal kam kɔ esa e Abalaam ɛ́ nɛ tsik dáa ekwyala di elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>É di'enek, bot ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛke náá, é sok Abalaam nadjɛ edyaal kam bɛ ɛ́, ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ náá, bɛdha ɛ Levi, bot ɛ di enɔɔ edyaal kam ɔ, bɛ naabaadjɛ yɔbɔ edyaal kam. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>É di'enek, é ghɛŋ Mɛlkisedɛk natɔ́ kɛboma nɛ Abalaam ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Levi dinaa ààbyel.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Etsi e bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, ye ɛ́ bɛdha Levi ɛ́ di egoka nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb. Bɔn ɛ Levi nadi bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ́ tyee mbi ɛ Alɔn. Tin, mbi yɔbɔ ɛdi ɛ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjala dáa ye di egoka ɛ. Ye ɛ́ pe di ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, «Aah» étɛp yé yɛ aabaadi nɛ dhiiti ghaa-Zɛɛb mbi yɛ Mɛlkisedɛk? <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ bɛ di eswola mɛzel mɛ ɛdi ɛ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ, ye baagoka ɛ́ náá, bɛ ɛswola etsi. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Etɛp bak liiaa ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu Ghɛŋ'enaka. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mot mbyak sis, tɔ yɔbɔ mbyak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghaa-Zɛɛb. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Menabɛlka djas nɛ guka náá, Ghɛŋ'enaka nabyel ɛ́ mot mbyak eYuda. Bela náá, é ghɛŋ Moiiz nadi elii dum nɛ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààtuwal mbyak tak.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dhiiti ghaa-Zɛɛb di enɔŋel nɛ Mɛlkisedɛk ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Beeka sa wat di elyaal náá etɛp binek ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ, dhiiti ghaa-Zɛɛb eebaatuula, nyɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ Mɛlkisedɛk. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi ghaa-Zɛɛb dum nɛ mɛtiŋ mɛ bot ɛ bɔs. Tin, nyɛ nadi ghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil tsik di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Deenek, ekwyala ɛpelɛɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">«Wɔ aadi ɛ́ ghaa-Zɛɛb kɔm-kɔm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">tyee wat nɛ Mɛlkisedɛk.»<verse eid="HEB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Deenek, etsi na mwa nadisaa ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi nɛ mɛbwala, ààval dhiiti sonok. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, etsi ɛ Moiiz ààpasa náá, bot di bot ɛ zedjala dáa ye di egoka ɛ. Tin, mbɛɛ ɛbwaalel naazedjɛaa mena, kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ́ mena di ekunaaka nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="HEB 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Etɛp binek nasael ɛ́ kɔ myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ Zɛɛb natuwal ɛ. Bɛdhiiti bot nadi bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ, Zɛɛb ààtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Yɛ kabɛ Yezu ɔɔ, nyɛ nadi ghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ́, é ghɛŋ Zɛɛb natuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">«Ghɛŋ eetuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">nyɛ aanàkabaaswoola yɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Wɔy ɛ́ ghaa-Zɛɛb kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm.”»<verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ di náá, Yezu ɛ́, mot di esa náá mena dika tɔ tɛtɛ ɛbhɛŋ dhaa yii na mwa ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Deenek, bɛtɛ nɛ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nadi edjilen ekɔkɔ nɛ ekɔkɔ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, ɛsyee nadi esa náá, bɛ nàsa mɛsa mɔɔ kɛkum mɛsik. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Tin, Yezu ɛ́ nɛ tsik kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm, deenek, nyɛ ɛ́ ghaa-Zɛɛb kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, nyɛ di nɛ ghwyil tsik bot ɛ di ekunaa nɛ Zɛɛb é ze'ɛ ɔ. Dáa ye di náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ tsik ɛ, nyɛ nɛ djaala Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ee nadi egoka nɛ nena ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ dɛɛ, ààbɛ nɛ ndjɛ, ààbɛ nɛ syem. Ye naawaa mbɛk pak nyɛy nɛ bot ɛ mesyem, nyɛ naabenaa ɛvyɛɛgɛpe pɛ tɔ gwoo. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>Nyɛ tok dáa bɛdhiiti bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nyɛ tok nɛ gwyes ɛka buwa mɛlu djas, étɛp mesyem mɛ met nɛghu mesyem mɛ bɛdhiiti bot. Nyɛ naazesa etɛp binek djas sok wat é ghɛŋ nyɛ naka nyel'ɛ met buwa ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Etsi ɛ Moiiz djɛ di ɛdi boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ́, nɛ bot ɛ di bɛ dinaa nɛ mendjɛ ɔ. Tin, myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ Zɛɛb natuwal bhis etsi ɛ lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, Mɔn di boo ghaa-Zɛɛb na kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm tɔ e dɛɛ.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛ́ di boo Ghaa-Zɛɛb'enaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Gwakeka sa di nɛ boo mɛtaŋ ee bis di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ bin ɛ: Ye ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe dáa ye di náá, menaka ɛ́ nɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb, nyɛ mot di ndiindel pɛ tɔ gwoo pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ boo mɛkoozi ɛ Zɛɛb mot di nɛ mɛbwala djas ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Nyɛ ɛpesa mɛsa mɛ tɔ di na Dɛɛ. Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ tɛtɛ pɛt di náá, Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb nyɛy ɛmet nasum ɛ, ààbɛ yii bot ɛ bɔs nasum ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb djas nanɛɛgaa tin ɛ, étɛp ɛgoola esa e ɛgwyena pɛ daa Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛka ebuwa. Tin, ye goka ɛ́ náá, boo Ghaa-Zɛɛb'ena Yezu baadi nɛ yɛ sa nyɛ aagwyena nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Tin, nyɛy ɛ́ pe di ɛ́ di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɔɔ, pe nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdi Ghaa-Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs, ye ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ di eka ebuwa dáa etsi ɛ Moiiz di elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Ghuna, mɛsa mɛ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb si esa tɔ ndjaa mendjaala ɛ, ye ɛ́ mbaŋa-mbaŋa esa di enɔŋel nɛ esa ee di esael pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ. É sok Moiiz nawaasum pɛt na Dɛɛ ɛ, Zɛɛb, naalɛɛ nyɛ náá: «Gwyáka, wɔ aasum yɛ ɛ, dáa wɔ nalyaalaa pɛ kɔ ɛtsok ɛ.»<verse eid="HEB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Tin, nenak yak, mɛsa mɛ Yezu di esa ɛ́, ye ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ di edhaa mɛsa djas ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛy ɛ́ mot nasɛ́ɛaa étɛp ɛduula pak bot nɛ Zɛɛb tɔ boo ɛbhɛŋ ɛ. Boo ɛbhɛŋ ɛ tak dum ɛ́ nɛ tɛtɛ ekɛk di edhaŋ ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Tin, ye ɛ́ pe di ɛ́ di náá, ɛbhɛŋ na mwa nadi ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ndjɛ tɔ tak ɔɔ, pe bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdis yɛ da swola yɛ nɛ dhiiti ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na bes. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Zɛɛb nadul bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ mɛlɔ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">«Mam Ghɛŋ ke ɛ́ náá: tɔ mɛlu di ezyɛ yenek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">mɛ waasa ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na bes,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">nɛ bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ kyee dik eYuda ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Yɛ aanàkwaadi tyee wat nɛ yii mɛ nasa nɛ bɛbhaab bɔɔ ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">é sok mɛ namɛt bɛ é mbɔ wyisal bɛ pɛ dik Eziptɛ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààlooba nɛ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ tak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Ghɛŋ eezɛke, e di tak ɛ mɛ nakin bɛ.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Ghɛŋ ke ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Beeka ɛbhɛŋ ɛ mɛ aasa nɛ bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">bhis mɛlu menek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">mɛ aakwyal mɛtiŋ mam tɔ esiiza bɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">mɛ aasɔn mɛtiŋ mam tɔ ebhum elyem bɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">mɛ aadi ɛ́ Zɛɛb'ɔɔ, tin, bɔɔ kadi ɛ́ bot ɛ mbyak'am!<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Tin, mot aanàkabaadi nɛ gwyes ɛdjɛ mot di é bhaaz'ɛ nɛghu mɔn ɛ nyɛɛg mɛlyo náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">“gua Ghɛŋ!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Etɛɛ náá, bot djas ɛ waagu mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">kana mɔn dhyeeb kɛkum boo-mot.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>É di'enek, mɛ waapel ɛdjak ɛ lɔɔ, mɛ aanàkabaataala mesyem mɔɔ.»<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>É sok nyɛ nadi elii dum nɛ ɛbhɛŋ na bes ɛ, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, ɛbhɛŋ ɛ mɛkɛn moo ɛ́ yii na mwa. Bela náá, sa di náá, ye moo ɛ́ na mwa ɛ, yɛ eezelɔɔd ɛ, kunaa ɛ́ nɛ ɛdiib.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb yii kɔ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Ɛbhɛŋ ɛ mɛkɛn nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛtiŋ étɛp ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb, zɛnɔɔ pɛt kɔ bɔs étɛp mendjaala. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>É di'enek, pɛt wat nadi nɛ mɛtsek mɛmbá ɛ naasumel. Ɛtsek ɛ mɛkɛn nadi edjóoaa ɛ́ «Di na Dɛɛ». Tɔ tak ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo lama na mengel etɛn nɛ ebá, zɛnɔɔ emesa nɛ emapa bɛ di eka Zɛɛb yɛ buwa ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Bhis kaad na pip-pip yii ɛbhis di ebɛk pɛt tak ɛ, ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti di bɛ di edjóo «Di na Dɛɛ Dhaa Nyel ɛ». <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>Ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mesa buwa nasael nɛ lɔɔad ɛ, étɛp ɛdik ɛ́ bɛmɛnanas, nɛ tot ɛbhɛŋ e lɔɔad. Tɔ tot ɛbhɛŋ ɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ loŋo nasael nɛ lɔɔad ɛ, ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ mapa nadi edus pɛ ɛko di edjóoaa man ɛ, zɛnɔɔ suub ɛ Alɔn, suub tak nadi ɛ́ ye moo nɛ bɔɔ eka egó e tak. Ye nabaabɛ ɛ́ nɛ epɛk mɛkok nakwyalaa mɛtiŋ mɛ ɛbhɛŋ kɔ tak ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Kɔ tot ɛbhɛŋ ɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛnaghisɛ efofop e duma nadi elyaal náá, Zɛɛb ɛ tinaak ɛ. Mɛbhap mɔɔ nadi elɛsa. Pyoo mɛbhap mɛ tak nadi ebutal tot ɛbhɛŋ. Nenak, yak ye tok ɛwala di náá, mena sɔs etɛp binek djas.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Eghɛŋ ye nadi náá, esa binek djas nabɛ ɛ́ yɛ eezekoobelaa ɛ́, bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nadi é nini mɛlu djas tɔ ɛtsek ɛ mɛken étɛp ɛkɛsa mɛsa mɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Tin, tɔ ɛtsek ebá e pɛt, ye ɛ́ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb nyɛy ɛmet ɛ́ di nɛ ghwyil ɛni penek, nyɛ zoni penek ɛ́, sok wat tɔ mbu. Nyɛ goka nɛ ɛni penek ɛ́ nɛ ghiya tit ee nyɛ di eka Zɛɛb buwa étɛp mesyem bɛ met nɛ yii bot. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>É di'enek, Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛpelyaal náá, dáa ɛtsek mɛkɛn dinaa tin ɛ, ye lyaal ɛ́ náá, di na dɛɛ dhaa nyel dinaa ndiila. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Etɛp binek nɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ etɛp mena kadi ebee mos'aak. Ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ náá, esa mot di egwyena nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, zɛnɔɔ ebuwa bɛtit mot di eka Zɛɛb yɛ ɛ, ye tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa náá, lyem mot di esa mbi mendjaala menek ɔ di mot zedjala ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>Mɛtiŋ menek dum ɛ́ nɛ esa e dek, nɛ mɛnyok, zɛnɔɔ dáa mot di egoka nɛ ɛsa étɛp ɛdis eduud ɛ. Ye ɛ́ mɛzel mɛ bot nazetawa nɛ ɛsa kɛkum é ɛwala Zɛɛb nakoobal esonok djas ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Tin, Klisto nazyɛ ɛ́ dáa boo ghaa-Zɛɛb e embɛɛ esa ee di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ. Nyɛ naani tɔ pɛt di enyɔ dhaa tyɛ ɛ, pɛt di náá, yɛ eezedjala nɛ di tak ɛ, pɛt di náá, ye tok bot ɛ bɔs nasum ɛ. Bela náá, pɛt tak tok kɔ bhwak nakusaa-kusak ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Eghɛŋ Klisto nani nia wat na kɔm-kɔm tɔ Di na Dɛɛ Dhaa Nyel ɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààka buwa ghiya ngom taa nɛghu yii mɔn ngɔmbɛ. Tin, nyɛ naka ɛ́ ghiya yɛ met, da pɛk mena sok wat ekeekee tɔ mesyem. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Ghiya engom engɔmbɛ nɛ engom etaa nɛghu mɛsii mɛ engɔmbɛ zedikaa, ee bɛ nadi emwam kɔ bot ɛ di nɛ edhuud ɔ, ye ɛ́ étɛp ye needis bɛ edhuud ɛ étɛp ɛbulal ɛgwakel ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ ɔɔ, ghiya ɛ Klisto eedhaa yenek boo dhaŋa. Nɛ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ, Klisto eeka nyel ɛmet nɛ Zɛɛb dáa tɛtɛ buwa di ààbɛ nɛ djam ɛ. Ghiya yɛ waagwyii elyem ee zeepulel nɛ mbee mɛsa mɛ di dul mena tɔ ɛsyee ɛ. Étɛp mena neesaka mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb mot di nɛ tsik ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ di náá, Klisto ɛ́ di mot di eduula pak Zɛɛb nɛ bot tɔ ɛbhɛŋ na bes ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ Zɛɛb nazedjóo ɔ, neebela esa e lyak na kɔm-kɔm ee nyɛ nakɛk bɛ ɛ. Tin, bɛ aabela yɛ ɛ dum nɛ ɛsyee mot ngɔt nagwyɛ ɔ. Kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ bot ɛ bɔs moo mos pɛka tɔ mesyem mɛ bɛ nasa si ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na mwa ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Edi di náá, mɛkana mɛ mɛlik naalikaa ɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, ye lyaalaa náá, mot nakwyal mɛkana mɛ mɛlik mɛ tak ɔ, naazegwyɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>É di'enek, mɛkana mɛ mɛlik ààval dhiiti sonok ye ɛ́ bɛ náá mot kwyal yɛ ɔɔ, di náá nɛ tsik. Tin, ye val ɛ́, ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, mot nakwyal yɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ eezekpaa nɛ mɛsyee gwyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ di náá, ɛbhɛŋ mɛkɛn nabɛ ɛ́ ààval ɛsok nɛ ghiya nɛ see. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Moiiz napokokan sok ɛ́ ɛlaa mɛtiŋ é mis mɛ bot djas, dáa ye nazodjɛaa nyɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, wɔ gwak nyɛ zɛnɔɔ ghiya e ngom etaa nɛ yii bɔn engɔmbɛ, dɔɔ nɛ mɛdii, myek yɛ kɔ mɛkana mɛ etsi dɔɔ nɛ é mɛnyel mɛ bot djas. Nyɛ naanɔɔ lɛɛ le di edjóoaa Izop ɛ nɛ mɔn pes kaad tiŋal é tak, étɛp ɛduu tɔ ghiya da myek yɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>Nyɛ naake náá: «Yak ɛ wak ɛ́ ghiya di elyaal ɛbhɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb djɛ bin náá, bi duwal ɛ.» <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Moiiz naabaamyek ghiya kɔ pɛt, nɛ kɔ esa djas di ebeaa étɛp ɛsa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Etsi lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, bɛ dis edhuud e sonok djas nɛ ghiya. Deenek, ye tok nɛ mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛbela ɛpelak mesyem yɛ bɛ náá, ghiya ààpasee ɔɔ.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Buwa ɛ Klisto di edis mesyem ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, embaŋa-mbaŋa esa ee di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdisaa edhuud ɛ deenek ɔɔ. É di'enek, esa ee di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ, ye ɛ́ nɛ gwyes buwa di nɛ boo mɛtaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Etɛɛ náá, Klisto nabɛ ɛ́ ààni tɔ di na Dɛɛ di náá, bot ɛ bɔs ɛ nasa nɛ mɛmbɔ mɔɔ ɛ. É di di náá, ye ɛ́ mbaŋa-mbaŋa tɛtɛ Di na Dɛɛ ɔ. Tin, nyɛ naani tɔ gwoo, nyɛ ɛ́ sok bhwoob ɛ Zɛɛb étɛp'ena. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Membu djas, boo ghaa-Zɛɛb bot ɛ mbyak eYuda dyeebani tɔ Di na Dɛɛ dhaa nyel ɛ sok wat nɛ ghiya tit. Tin, Klisto nabɛ ɛ́ ààni esok nɛ esok étɛp kɛka nyel'ɛ buwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Ye ɛ́ pe bɛ náá, ye nasael ɛ́ deenek ɔɔ, pe Klisto nazuk ɛ́ esok nɛ esok kana bhwak nakusel ɛ. Nenak dáa ye di náá, bhwak moo ɛ́ pɛ mɛsik ɛ, Klisto nazotuula ɛ́ sok wat étɛp ɛpel ɛ́ mesyem. Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ nyɛ naka nyel ɛmet buwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Bot djas kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛgwyɛ sok wat, bhii tak Zɛɛb ɛpɛ́ɛ bɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>Ye ɛ́ tyee wat dáa Klisto naka nyel'ɛ buwa étɛp ɛpel mbula mesyem mɛ bot ɛ bɔs ɛ. Tin, nyɛ waabaatuula ɛ tuula sis, é sok yenek yɛ aanàkabaadi étɛp ɛpel ɛ mesyem. Deenek, yɛ aakadi ɛ́ étɛp ɛdjɛ tsik nɛ bot ɛ di egwaal ɛtuula ɛ lɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Etsi ɛ Moiiz nazobɛ ɛ́ mbaŋa-mbaŋa di elyaal mena embɛɛ esa aasael djɛmɛn ɛ. Tin, ye ààlyaal etsɛɛtsɛ etɛp e tak dáa ye di ɛ. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, ye tok nɛ ghwyil ɛ dis edhuud e bot ɛ di esaŋ ɛkunaa nɛ Zɛɛb é ɛkeka mbi buwa wat membu nɛ membu ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Ye ɛ́ pe di ɛ́ di náá, kwaambi yenek ɛdjaala Zɛɛb ɛpedis bot edhuud nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ ɔ, pe bɛ aanàkabaadi nɛ mesyem. Tin, bot ɛ waakat ɛbaakeka buwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Tin, ebuwa binek ɛ di esa náá, mot gheetetaala mesyem mɛ nyɛ nadi esa membu nɛ membu ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Etɛɛ náá, ghiya ngom bhata nɛ yii ngom ngɔmbɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdis mesyem mɛ bot.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak, é sok Klisto nadi ezyɛ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ, nyɛ naake nɛ Zɛɛb náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">«wɔ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ gwyes buwa, ààbɛ nɛ gwyes esa e ɛgwyena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">tin, wɔ naasa náá, mɛ di nɛ nyel.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Wɔ nabɛ ɛ́ ààmyaala nɛ buwa nadikaa wɔ kɔ Mesa buwa ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:6">nɛghu ebuwa nakaa wɔ étɛp ɛpel mesyem mɛ bot ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>É di'enek, mɛ naazɛke náá, “Zɛɛb'am, mɛ eezyɛ pɛ daa lɔ mam mɛ ɛmet,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">étɛp ɛsa ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">dáa ye nakwyalaa dum nɛ nam tɔ mɛkana ɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.5-7</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛd40.7-9.</char></note>”»<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Tin, nyɛ nakan ɛke sok ɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">«Wɔ ààpakwyɛl buwa, nɛghu esa e ɛgwyena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">wɔ ààpakwyɛl bɛtit zedikaa kɔ mesa buwa ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">nɛghu buwa dikaa étɛp ɛpel ɛ mesyem mɛ bot ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">wɔ nabɛ ɛ́ ààmyaala nɛ sa wat.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 10:8">Dhi buwa binek di ekaa dáa etsi di elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:9">«Beea mɛ, mam mɛ ɛmet eezyɛ zɛsa ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 10:9">Deenek, Klisto eedis buwa na mwan, nyɛ eedjila nɛ buwa yɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Yezu Klisto naasa ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb, deenek, nyɛ naaka nyel'ɛ met buwa sok wat kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm. Tin, nyɛ naasa náá, mena dika bot ɛ edɛɛ.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛpelak nɛ ɛdi sɛŋ ààbɛ nɛ edhuud dum nɛ Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Ghaa-Zɛɛb djas dyeebadi ɛ́ titel mɛlu djas étɛp ɛsa mɛsa mɛ, étɛp ɛka buwa tak wat mɛlu djas. Bela náá, buwa tak tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdis mot mesyem. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Tin, Klisto nyɛ ɛmet nazokabuwa ɛ́ sok wat étɛp ɛdis ɛ bot mesyem, bhii tak, nyɛ moo ɛ́ ndiindel pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Nenak, ye ɛ́ tin ɛ nyɛ di ebwood náá, Zɛɛb sa náá, bot ɛ mɛbhuka mɛ di dáa poba bɛ di ekɛl mɛko ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Deenek, nɛ buwa tak wat, nyɛ naadis bot edhuud disa wat ekeekee étɛp bot needi dɛɛ.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Tin, dɔɔ nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛpebaalɛɛ mena náá, yɛ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ pooke ɛ náá:<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>«Ghɛŋ ke ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Beea Ɛbhɛŋ ɛ mɛ aasa nɛ nɔɔ ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">bhis mɛlu menek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Mɛ aakwyal mɛtiŋ mam ɛ́ tɔ ebhum elyem bɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Mɛ aasɔn yɛ tɔ esiiza bɔɔ.<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaazɛke náá: Mɛ aanàbaataala ɛdjak ɛ lɔɔ, nɛghu mesyem mɔɔ.»<verse eid="HEB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Ghuna, é di mesyem di epelaa ɛ, bot tokapɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛbaaka buwa étɛp mesyem.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Djhookunaaka nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>É di'enek, bɔn nyɛɛg bam, menaka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, mena waanika tɔ di na Dɛɛ dhaa nyel kɔ ɛsu ghiya ɛ Yezu naso tyee buwa ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Nyɛ naazedii mena ze na bes di nɛ tsik, nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet na kan ɛdhaa é ze boo kaad di ebɛk Ndjaa-ebuwa, ee kwyɛl ɛlyaal é nyel'ɛ met. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Tin, menaka ɛ́ nɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb, mot di kukuma di edjɛɛd ndjaa Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>Djhookunaaka nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ lyem wat, nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ nɛ Zɛɛb zepyet ɛ, ghiya ɛ Yezu gwyii embee esiiza di tɔ bhum elyem bena ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ mɛnyel mena gwyiia nɛ tɛtɛ mɛdii. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Djhoobaalka ɛlyelɛpe ɛbwaalel ɛ mena di goolaka ɛ, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ sosoob tɔ ekɛk bɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Djhookwyɛɛgelka pak'ena étɛp ɛdjɛ mena mɛghaaz tɔ kwyɛl nɛ ɛsa enɛm esa. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Sa mena ààkatka ɛtɔ́ pɛ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala, dáa bɛdhiiti bot moo nɛ mɛfulu mɛ ɛsa yɛ mos ɛ. Tin, mena goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdjɛelka mɛghaaz pak'enaka, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛpebee biyɔ bɛmet náá, ɛlu ɛ Ghɛŋ eezekunaa.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Etɛɛ náá, bhis bot aazegu etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ, mena baasyemka nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ lina ɔɔ, ye tokapɛ nɛ buwa ɛpelak é mesyem. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>Ye kalik mena ɛ́, ɛgwaal tɔ mɛnyɛnyɛ epɛ́ɛ e Zɛɛb nɛ boo du na goo-goo bot ɛ mɛbhuka mɛ aadyak ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Mot ɛ di ààlooba nɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz ɔɔ, nyɛ góaa ààbɛ nɛ ghoŋ, ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, bɛtsaases ebá nɛghu bɛlɛl eemyaal sa nyɛ sa ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>É di'enek, yɛ aakadi tin dáa nɛ mot di ebhina mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nɛ mot di ebee ghiya ɛbhɛŋ ɛ nasa náá, ɛgwakel baabula pak bot nɛ Zɛɛb é mis toto ɔ, nɛ mot di elee Sisim di ɛsuk ɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ɔ? Bi pookogek mbi feŋ yenɔk mot di egoka nɛ ɛbela ɛ? <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Tin, mena nɛ guka mot nalɛɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">«Ye ɛ́ mam ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛbulal ɛbiyo nɛ ɛbiyo, mam ɛ di edjɛ efute ɛbiyo mot nɛ mot»,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">nyɛ naabaalɛɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">«Ghɛŋ ɛ́ waapɛ́ɛ bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ.»<verse eid="HEB 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Ye ɛ́ àànyɔ náá, mot di nɛ ndjɛ é mis mɛ Zɛɛb mot di nɛ tsik ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Pokotaalaka é ghɛŋ sok, é sok Zɛɛb nabɛɛ bin mis étɛp bin neegu etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ. Bi naasa mɛghaaz tɔ eboo mezuk bi naboma nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Bɛdhiiti bot pak'en naaleeaa, tiigaa é mis mɛ bot, bela náá, bɛdhiiti bot nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ lyem ɛkwyee bot ɛ nadi ezuk nɛ ɛtiigaa dáa bɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Bi naazuk lɔɔg wat nɛ bot ɛ membok. Bi nadi ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala é sok bɛ nadɛk mɛvu men ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ gu náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ tɛtɛ mɛvu di kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Sa bi ààbulal lyem bhis dum nɛ ɛbwaalel bi di nɛ yɛ ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bi aabela boo efute. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bi wa zii étɛp bi neesa ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp bi neebela sa nyɛ nakɛk bin ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Tin, ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">«Tɔ mɔn ɛwala, tɔ ba mɔn pes ɛwala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">mot di egoka nɛ ɛzyɛ ɔ, nyɛ waazyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">ɛzyɛ ɛ lɛ eezekunaa.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>É di'enek, mot di tɔ epiki é mis mam tɔ ɛdum ɛkoŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ waatsak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">tin, nyɛ bula bhis ɔɔ, mɛ aanàkwaamyaala nɛ nɛ.»<verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Mena tokeka bot ɛ di ebula bhis tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, da wo ze ɔ. Menaka ɛ́, bot ɛ di tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, bot ɛ di tɔ ze tsik na kɔm-kɔm ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, ɛdi nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, sa wɔ di ebun ɛ wɔ waabela yɛ. Ye ɛ́ ɛmyaal nɛ lyem wat náá, sa di ààbeeaa nɛ mis ɛ ye ɛ́ tak nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Ye ɛ́ dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, Zɛɛb naamyaal bot ɛ na mwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>Ye ɛ́ dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, bot di egu náá, bhwak nakusaa ɛ́ nɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, esa ee di beeaa ɛ nasael nɛ esa ee nadi ààbeeaa ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Ye ɛ́ dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, Abhɛl nadjɛ Zɛɛb esa ɛgwyena dhaa yii mɔn ɛ nyɛɛg Kayin. Ye ɛ́ dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, Zɛɛb nabee nyɛ dáa mot e piki, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet naamyaala nɛ esa ɛgwyena ɛ lɛ. Ye nakoozodi náá, Abhɛl naazegwyɛ, etɛp nyɛ nasa ɛ́ dinaa egek.<verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Ye ɛ́ dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, Enɔk nabyet tɔ́ pɛ tɔ gwoo étɛp nyɛ needi ààgwyɛ. Tin, mot nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabaabela nyɛ, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb naaben nyɛ pɛ tɔ gwoo. Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛ tɔ́ tɔ gwoo, Zɛɛb na myaala nɛ nɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naadi ɛ esa Zɛɛb edjɔɔ emis. <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Bela náá, Zɛɛb tok nɛ ghwyil bela edjɔɔ emis nɛ mot di ààdum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔɔ. Tin, mot di tiila Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ goka ɛmyaal náá, Zɛɛb ɛ é tak. Nyɛ nɛ djɛ efute nɛ bot di esaa nyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Ye ɛ́ dum nɛ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, Noe nagwak sa Zɛɛb nalɛɛ nyɛ dum nɛ sa nakoosael ɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bot dinaa ààbee sa tak. Nyɛ naadyeebawa lyem tɔ etɛp Zɛɛb nalɛɛ nyɛ. Nyɛy batasa mɛsuwa mɛ nyɛ natsik nyel ɛmet nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ ɛ. É sok nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ, ye nabɛɛ nyɛ naakwyesal bot ndjɛ sɔs. E di'enek, dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Zɛɛb, Zɛɛb naabee nyɛ dáa mot epiki.<verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, Abalaam nalooba nɛ ndjóoel ɛ Zɛɛb é sok nyɛ nadjóo nyɛ ɛ. Wɔ gwak nyɛ zɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Zɛɛb naakɛk náá, nyɛ aadjɛ nyɛ ɛ. Tin, nyɛ naazɛtɔ́, ààgu pɛ kyee nyɛ di etɔ́ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ naadi tyee ndjoŋ kɔ kyee dik Zɛɛb nakɛk nyɛ ɛ. Tin, nyɛ nadidi ɛ́ pɛ tɔ pɛt, tyee wat nɛ Izak, zɛnɔɔ Zakɔɔb bot ɛ nabela mbi ekɛk é tak wat ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Etɛɛ náá, Abalaam nadi ebhwood ɛ́ boo ghaada di nɛ ghus-zumal na lyel-lyel ɛ. Ghaada di náá, Zɛɛb nyɛy ɛmet ɛ di mot di ekoobal dáa yɛ aasael, ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ sum yɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, Saala nyɛ ɛmet, ye nakoozodi náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ kwyiid, tɔa moma. Zɛɛb naadjɛ nyɛ ghwyil ɛbela ɛ bɛdha. Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛbwaalel náá, Zɛɛb ɛ sosoob nɛ ekɛk bɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, bhaab'enaka ngɔt Abalaam, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nyɛ moo tɔa-mot, nyɛ eezekunaa nɛ ɛsyee. Ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ́ nadi ɛsuk ɛ mɛbyel mɛ bot ɛbuɛpe. Bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ tak bu ɛ́ dáa ekwyikwyen tɔ gwoo, nɛghu dáa bɛsyɛ é ɛboŋ ɛ boo dii mɛsɔn mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛ laa bɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Bot binɔk djas nagwyɛ ɛ́, bɔɔ é dum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ nagwyɛ ɛ́ ààbela ekɛk Zɛɛb nakɛk bɛ ɛ. Tin, bɛ nazobee yɛ nɛ ɛmyaala yɛ ɛ nɛ ɛtseta. Bɛ naagu yɛ popoopwon náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ bɛndjoŋ, ekpaa-goŋ kɔ bɔs. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Bot ɛ di elii deenek ɔ, bɛ lyaal popoopwon ɛ náá, bɛ ɛpesaa kyee dik di náá, ye di yɔbɔ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Tin, bɛ pe diɛ di etaala kyee dik bɛ nadus pɛ ezaag ɔ, pe bɛ eezebela ze ɛsik ɛ penek. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, bɛ kwyɛl ɛ mbɛɛ kyee dik di eedhaa yak ɛ, kyee dik di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ di náá, Zɛɛb tok nɛ syen ɛmyaal náá, nyɛ di Zɛɛb'ɔɔ. Tin, nyɛ eezekoobal bɛ tɛtɛ ghaada.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, Abalaam naaka Izak buwa, é ghɛŋ Zɛɛb nawa nyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal ɛ. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nyɛ moo babeega étɛp ɛka sɛŋɛlɛ mɔn'ɛ ngɔt é buwa dhi nyɛ é gu náá, nyɛ naabela ekɛk. <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>Zɛɛb naalɛɛ nɛ nɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 11:18">«Ye ɛ́ dum nɛ Izak ɛ wɔ aabela bɛdha ye mɛ nakɛk wɔ ɛ.»<verse eid="HEB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Deenek, Abalaam nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, Zɛɛb ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛgomal Izak mɔn'ɛ pak myoŋ. Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, Zɛɛb nabulal nyɛ mɔn tak. Tin, ye lyaal ɛ́ ɛkɛɛ Izak gomelaa ɛ́ pak bɛ myoŋ.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, Izak naasɛɛ Zakɔɔb nɛ Ezau mɛtel etɛp esa ye di eezyɛ pɛ sok ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, Zakɔɔb nasɛɛ mɔn ɛ Zozɛf mɛtel ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛ gwyɛ. Nyɛ nadi epyet nɛ suub étɛp ɛ́ ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, Zozɛf, ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛ gwyɛ, nyɛ naalɛɛ náá, bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl ɛ waawyis tɔ dik Eziptɛ. Nyɛ naabaalɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ wyis nɛ egwyes e nyel'ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg ɛ Moiiz naasyel nyɛ edi bɛngɔn ɛlɛl bhis ɛbyel ɛ lɛ. É sok bɛ naabee náá, mɔn tɔlɔɔ tak nabɛ ɛ́ nɛm ɛ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààgwak bwoo ɛbyen ɛlooba nɛ mɛtiŋ ɛ Mɛkoozi.<verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, esok, Moiiz nadi nyɛ moo boo-mot ɛ, nyɛ naabyen ɛdi ɛ mɔn ɛ ɛsyes ɛ Falaɔŋ. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Moiiz, naamyaal náá, nyɛ tiigaa sama wat nɛ bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ naabyen ɛdi ɛ tɔ mɛmyaala mɛ etɛp e mesyem, mɛmyaala mɛ esa ye di ààbɔya ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Nyɛ naadi bee ɛ náá, ɛdukaa dáa Klisto nadukaa ɛ, yii dhaa mɛvu djas di kɔ kyee dik Eziptɛ nɛ boo mɛtaŋ. Etɛɛ náá, mis mɛ nadi edjoak ɛ, efute bɛ ee di ezyɛ ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, Moiiz naadus kɔ dik Eziptɛ ààkaab ɛbuk ɛ Falaɔŋ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ghiŋ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛkɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ebee Zɛɛb mot di ààbeaa ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, Moiiz naakus ɛbyoŋ ɛ pak. Tin, nyɛ naazɛdjɛ ɛlee náá, bɛ lɔɔb ghiya é mɛbɛ mɛ mendjaa. Etɛɛ náá, é sok fofop ɛsyee aadhaŋ ɛ, nyɛ needi ààgó bɔn ɛ mɛgwyak mɛ bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl.<verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl nasɛɛ boo dii mɛsɔn tɔɔbelaa nɛ mɛko mɔɔ ɛkɛɛ ye nabɛ ɛ́ tɛtɛ gba bot di eezyɛ nɛ ɛdhaŋ ɛ. Tin, é sok bot ɛ Eziptɛ nawaabaŋaa bɛ ɛ, bɔɔ djas naasi «bhɛɛɛ» tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn.<verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, eboo epap e ghaada Yeliko naabik bhis bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl naakii ghaada tɔ mɛlu mɛ etɛn nɛ ebá ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, Laab, moma mɛzɔ nabɛ ɛ́ ààgwyɛ sama nɛ bot nadi ààlooba nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naasyel ɛnyɔɛpe bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl, bot nazyɛ zɛbee ghaada tɔ sɔ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Bi kwyɛl náá, mɛ baake dáa? Mɛ tok nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ ɛwala étɛp ɛkaada bin etɛp kɔ ɛsu Zedeɔŋ, Bhalak, Samsɔŋ, Zɛfte, nɛ Dhavid, zɛnɔɔ Samyɛl dɔɔ nɛ bɛdhiiti bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>Dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, bɛ naakwak bɛ mɛyoŋ, bɛ naakɛ tɔ epiki, bɛ nabela sa Zɛɛb nakɛk bɛ ɛ, bɛ naadiyal eboo bɛghee enuub, <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>bɛ naadimal eboo mu, bɛ naadus é eban mɛsyee mɛ bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛgó bɛ nɛ epɛl ɛ, bɛ naabaabela ghwyil bhis mɛbɛ, bɛ naalyaal ghwyil ɔɔ, é sok bɛ nadi elumla dɛɛb ɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛ sɔ esodja é bɛdhiidi mɛdhik mɛsis.<verse eid="HEB 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Boa naabee dáa bot bɔɔ nazegwyɛ ɔ nagom ɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Bɛdhiiti botom naabiaa ɛlyelɛpe, bɛ naabyen mɛpɛka étɛp ɛgom, étɛp ɛbela tɛtɛ tsik. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Tin, bɛdhiiti naadukaa, biyaa nɛ eghwyɛs, bak bɛdhiiti naakɔlaa nɛ ekel e ghwooz, waaa é membok. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Bɛdhiiti bot naagóaa nɛ mɛkok, syakaa ebhil ebá, góaa nɛ epɛl, bɛdhiiti bot nabɛ ɛ́ etɔ́ nɛ ɛtwol edi, Ekaad bɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ eket etaa nɛ yii bhata, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ bɛdjel ɛ bot, bɛ nadi etiigaa nɛ ɛzukaa. <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Bhwak nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi nɛ gwyes mbi binɔk bot. Bɛ nadi ekɛ ghooghoŋ ɛbaabat pɛ kyee mɛdhik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdhii ɛ, nɛ pɛ kɔ mɛtsok. Bɛ nadi edjedjaasi ɛ tɔ egho e mɛkok dɔɔ nɛ tɔ bhik di tɔ bɔs ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Zɛɛb naamyaal bot binɔk djas kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb. Bela náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbela sa Zɛɛb nakɛk ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Tin, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Zɛɛb naazekobal mena sa di ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ nena ɛ. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, nyɛ nabɛɛ aakwyɛl náá, bɛkum di di eedjala ɔ menabɛlka di ààdi ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Feŋ ɛ Zɛɛb dum nɛ bɔn ɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Yɛ kabɛ menabɛlka ɔ, menaka ɛ́ kuku bɛtɛ nɛ bɛtyaasɛs. Djhoodiska esa djas di esa náá, mena nàkɛka ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ, daŋ-daŋ ɛ mesyem mɛ mena di esesa ngwyis ɛ. Tin, djhoopatka kaab ee bɛ náá, mena kaabka ɛ́ kɛkum pɛ ɛsik. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Mis mena goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdjoak ɛ Yezu, nyɛy ɛ́ di esa náá, mena dika nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ ɛ́ baadi esa náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lena nɛ Zɛɛb kum di di edjala ɔ. Nyɛ naamyaal ɛgwyɛ kɔ mɛlaaba, ààgwak syen, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ebee mɛmyaala mɛ di ebwood nyɛ bhii tak ɛ. Nenak, nyɛ ɛ́ ndiindel pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ boo mɛkoozi Zɛɛb.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Taalaka nɛ nɛ, nɛ dáa nyɛ nazemaad swaka bot ɛ mesyem ɛ. Deenek, bi aanàbet náá, bi kwyeselaa, bi aanàbula pɛ bhis tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Etɛɛ náá, tuub bi di eduu nɛ syem ɛ, bi dinaa ààpaaduu yɛ kɛmyaal náá, bi gwyɛ. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Bi eezedjisa mɛghaaz mɛ Zɛɛb di edjɛ bin dáa bɔn bɛ ɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">«Mɔn'am sa wɔ ààbyasal feŋ Zɛɛb di ewa wɔ é tak ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">é sok nyɛ di ewa wɔ é feŋ ɛ, sa wɔ ààbula bhis.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Etɛɛ náá, Ghɛŋ dyeebawa é feŋ ɛ́ mot nyɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:6">nyɛ dyeebabi ɛ́, mot nyɛ di ebee nyɛ dáa mɔn'ɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Maadka mezuk mɛ Zɛɛb di ezuk bin é sok nyɛ di ewa bin é feŋ ɛ, nyɛ bee bin tin ɛ dáa bɔn ɛ bɛ. Ye ɛ́ nɛ mɔn di náá, sɛɛg ààwa nyɛ é feŋ e? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Ye ɛ́ bɛ náá, bi ààpawaa é feŋ dáa nyɛ di esa nɛ bɔn bɛ ɔɔ, é di'enek, ye lyaal ɛ́ náá, bi tok bɛtɛtɛ bɔn bɛ. Tin, bi tok esɛŋɛlɛ bɔn bɛ. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Djhoopokonɔɔka geka bɛbyael bena kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs. Eghɛŋ bɛ nadi ewa feŋ ɛ, mena nadi egwak bɛ. «Aah» djoata nɛ Sɛɛg'enaka mot di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ, mena goka ɛ́ nɛ gwak nyɛ dhaa tyɛ étɛp mena needika nɛ tsik. <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Deenek, bɛsɛɛg bena nadyeebawewa mena é feŋ ɛ, é ba mɔɔ pes ɛwala dáa elyem bɔɔ di ekwyɛl ɛ. Tin, Zɛɛb wa mena é feŋ ɛ, étɛp mɛvu mena met, etɛɛ náá, mena neebela di tɔ eDɛɛ bɛ. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Eghɛŋ mena di eduwaa é feŋ ɛ, ye ɛ́ nɛ nena ɛkɛɛ ɛwala ɛ mot nɛ ghoŋ tɔ lyem ɛ, ààbɛ yii mɛmyaala. Bhii tak, bot ɛ nawaa é kwaambi yenek mbi feŋ ɔ, bɛ aakadi ɛ́ bɛ moo bot ɛ epiki, nɛ bot ɛ egwyem.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛdjɛaa mɛghaaz nɛ ɛdulaa ɛ mɛlɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Sɛɛbka mɛmbɔ men zetyak ɛ, lyelka mɛboŋ men di epwak ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Beta náá, mɛko men du mɛze mɛ di piki ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛko mɛ mot di nɛ djam ɔ ɛzɛkɛpiiza, tin, ye nyɔ ɛ́ nyɛ tsak.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Saka mɛghaaz mɛ ɛdi ɛ tɔ egwyem nɛ bot djas, saka mɛghaaz mɛ ɛdi ɛ́ tɔ tsik edɛɛ ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, yɛ di ààbɛ deenek ɔɔ, ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt aabee Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Bi ɛ́ koobaka, sa mot ààsaa náá, nyɛ su enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb. Sa mot ngɔt pak'en ààdi dáa le na gwyee-gwyee, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛpul bɛtɛ nɛ bot pak'en nɛ mɛgwyee mɛ tak. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Sa mot ngɔt tɔ len ààsa mɛzɔ, sa mot ààbyasal esa e Dɛɛ, dáa Ezau mot nagwyena etooba bɛ étɛp edee ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Biyɔ bɛmet nɛ gu náá, bhii tak, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes náá, sɛɛg sɛɛ nyɛ mɛtel. Tin, wɔ gwaa sɛɛg byen ɛsɛɛ nyɛ mɛtel. É di'enek, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbela ghwyil ɛswoola lyem sɛɛg, ye nakoozodi mɛgwyɛ mɛ.<verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Eghɛŋ bi nakunaa nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ kɔ ɛtsok ɛ di náá, bot ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛmɛt ɛ: ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ boo du, ààbɛ nɛ ghooghom, ààbɛ nɛ pum, ààbɛ-bɛak nɛ boo ghuu, <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>bi nàbɛ ɛ́ ààgwak lii tɔŋ, ààgwak-gwakak gwood tuud. Eghɛŋ bɔn Yisalaɛl nawgwak yɛ ɛ, bɛ naabyen ɛbaagwak gwood tak. <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>Deenek, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛmaad lwomel'enek: «Mot aazomɛt ɛtsok ɛlak ɔ, ye nakoozodi tit, nyɛ aagóaa ɛ́ nɛ mɛkok.» <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Kɔ ɛsu ɛ esa ee bɛ nadi ebee ɛ, wɔ gwak Moiiz zɛke náá: «Mɛ ɛpepwak, mɛ ɛpedyeebagwak bwoo!»<verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Tin, bi naakunaa nɛ ɛtsok ɛ Siɔŋ, bi naakunaa nɛ ghaada Zɛɛb mot di nɛ tsik ɔ. Ye ɛ́ Ghaada Yeluzalɛm di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ, ye ɛ́ pɛ efofop bɛdhet nɛ bɛdhet di tɔ ɛbyoŋ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Bi nabɛ ɛ́, bi naazekunaa nɛ dhiiti zɛɛga bot ɛ nadi tɔ ɛbyoŋ ɔ. Zɛɛga tak nabɛ ɛ́ yii bɔn mɛgwyak ɛ Zɛɛb, bot ɛ di náá, min mɔɔ moo ɛ́ ekwyala pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ. Bi eezekunaa nɛ Zɛɛb, mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ bhwak djas ɔ. Bi eezekunaa nɛ esisim di náá, yɛ eezedjala ɛ́. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Bi nabɛ ɛ́, bi eezekunaa nɛ Yezu, mot di ebulal kwyɛl ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na bes ɔ. Nyɛy mot ghiya yɛ nasee ɔ, ghiya tak ɛpetuud ɛlyelɛpe dhaa-dhaŋak ghiya ɛ Abhɛl.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Dika ndjem, sa bi ààbyen ɛgwak mot di elii nɛ nen ɔ. Bot ɛ nabyen ɛgwak ɛ mot nadi edul bɛ mɛlɔ kɔ bɔs ɔ, bɛ naaboma nɛ yɔbɔ feŋ. Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, dɔɔ nɛ menabɛlka pe, mena aanàdus é feŋ, mena aadi ààlooba nɛ mot di elii nɛ nena pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Eghɛŋ sok, gwood'ɛ naasa náá, bɔs dheegel, nenak, nyɛ eekɛk mena náá: «Mɛ waabaadheeg bɔs dheega sis, dɔɔ nɛ gwoo.» <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Mɛkpa mɛ di ekeaa wak náá: «Dheega sis» ɛ, kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ náá, esa ee nakusaa ɛ waadheegel dhaa tyɛ, bhii tak yɛ ɛ diib étɛp ɛdjɛ di nɛ esonok di náá, ye tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdheegel ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Djhoobulalka bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, mena aabelaka ɛyoŋ ɛ di ààdheegel ɛ. Djhoolyaalka bhɔɔ tak tɔ ɛsa mɛ mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb tyee wat di náá, lyem'ɛ waamyaala nɛ yɛ ɛ. Djhoosaka yɛ tɔ ɛkaab nɛ ɛlooba nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb'enaka ɛ́ du di edik esonok djas ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mena aasaka dáa étɛp Zɛɛb neemyaala nɛ nena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Geekwyekwyɛlelka pak'en dáa bɛkɛl nɛ bɛdhem. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Sa mot ààdjisa ɛdjɛ bɛdjoŋ ɛ di ezyɛ pɛ daa len ɔ edi. Etɛɛ náá, é ɛsa deenek, bɛdhiiti bot naadjɛ efofop nazyɛ mɛdjoŋ pɛ daa lɔɔ edi, bɔɔ ààgu náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ efofop. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Taalaka nɛ bot ɛ di tɔ membok ɛkɛɛ náá, biyɔ pe e membok bi nɛ bɛ nɔɔ. Taalaka nɛ bot ɛ di tɔ mɛtiiga ɔ, etɛɛ náá, biyɔ pe ɛ́ bot nɛ mɛnyel nɛ epuud, di nɛ ghwyil tiigaa ɛ dáa bɔɔ ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bot djas duwal ɛbá, tin ye baagoka ɛ́ náá, moma nɛ motom kɛ tɔ esosoob dum nɛ ɛbá. Etɛɛ náá Zɛɛb waapɛ́ɛ bot ɛ mɛzɔ nɛ bot ɛ membyam.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Yɛ ààgoka náá, gwyes epata djɛɛd bin. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bi myaala nɛ esa bi di nɛ yɛ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb nyɛy ɛmet ke ɛ́ náá: «Ààbɛ, mɛ aanàkwaabyen wɔ, mɛ aanàkwaapek wɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dɛt 31.6,8; Yos 1.5</char></note>.» <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>É tɛp tak ɛ di náá, mena ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛke nɛ ɛbwaalel djas náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">«Ghɛŋ ɛ mot di ekyee mɛ ɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛ di nɛ bwoo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Mot aakoosa mɛ ye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛd 118.6</char></note>?»<verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Taalaka nɛ bot ɛ nadi edjɛɛd bin ɔ, bot ɛ nagoola bin mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Deenek, taalaka nɛ dáa bɛ nadi ekɛ ɛ, nɛ dáa bɛ nagwyɛ ɛ. Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbaŋa mbi ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb bɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Yezu Klisto ɛ́ tyɛ wat koko, mos, kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm.<verse eid="HEB 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Sa bi ààbet náá, mɛlyo mbɛs yii bot ɛ sis sa náá, bi wo ze. Ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb djɛ mena mɛghaaz. Ààkabɛ náá, ye di etsi bot zesa dum nɛ edee mena di edɛka ɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Bɛghaa-Zɛɛb di esa mɛsa tɔ pɛt mɛ bhoma ɔ, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdɛ esa di ekaa kɔ mesa ebuwa bena ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Boo ghaa-Zɛɛb dyeebatɔ́ pɛ tɔ di na Dɛɛ ɛ nɛ ghiya bɛtit. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ neeka yɛ buwa étɛp ɛpelak mesyem. Tin, epuud bɛtit binek wyisa nɛ yɛ tɔ ghaada ɛ, kɛdikaa pɛ kel. <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, Yezu nadi ààgwyɛ tɔ ghaada, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ neegwyii bot nɛ ghiya yɛ ɛmet. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Djhoowyiska tɔ ghaada, kɛboma nɛ nɛ pɛ kel, etɛɛ náá, mena neekɛbomaka nɛ mbi mɛduka mɛ nyɛ nadukaa ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Etɛɛ náá, kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs wak, mena tokeka nɛ ghaada di nɛ ghwyil ɛdi kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm ɛ. Mena saaka wak ɛ, ghaada di ezyɛ yenek. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu, djhoogheekaka mɛlu djas Zɛɛb ebuwa é mɛpka mɛ di djɛ nyɛ duu ɛ, ye ɛ́ mɛdjeeb mɛ di lyaal náá, nyɛy ɛ́ Ghɛŋ ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Sa bi ààdjisa ɛsesa enɛm esa, nɛ ɛkye-kyeel pak'en. Yenek ɛ́ buwa Zɛɛb di emyaala nɛ yɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Loobaka nɛ bɛdjɛɛdel bin, gwakeka bɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ ɛpebaal bin mɛlu djas. Guka náá, bɛ waabookɛtaŋal é mis mɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. Tin, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsa náá, bɛ sa mɛsa mɔɔ ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ lyem wat, ààkabɛ náá, bɛ sa yɛ nɛ mɛnwyaad. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ sa yɛ nɛ mɛnwyaad ɔɔ, yɛ aanàkwaanyɔ nɛ nen.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Djaalaka étɛp'es! Bis ɛpegu tɔ elyem bis náá, elyem bis ɛ́ sɛŋ. Deenek, sa di nɛ nis ɛ, ye ɛ́ náá, mɛwala djas, bis ɛ́ tɔ ɛsɛɛga ɛdi nɛ mbɛɛ mɛfulu. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Sa mɛ di ewaab nɛ nen daŋ-daŋ ɛ́ náá, djaalaka nɛ Zɛɛb náá, nyɛ sa náá, mɛ lel ɛbula pɛ daa len.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛkwosak ɛ lam dum nɛ bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Zɛɛb ɛ́ ɛsuk ɛ egwyem, nyɛ naagomal Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu pak myoŋ. Yezu moo mos ɛ́, boo djɛɛdel ebhata kɔ ɛsu ɛ ghiya yɛ, ghiya di ewa mena tɔ ɛbhɛŋ na kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm ɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>Beta náá, Zɛɛb tak wat djɛ bin ghwyil ɛsesa enɛm esa, étɛp bi neesa ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ. Tin, Zɛɛb sa nɛ nen sa lyem'ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛ é ze ɛ Yezu Klisto, mot di egoka nɛ ɛdjɛaa duu kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm ɔ! Amɛn.<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛpka mɛ mɛsik nɛ mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, mɛ waab nɛ nen ɛ́ náá: Gwakeka nɛ lyem wat mɛkpa mɛ di edjɛ mɛghaaz ɛ. Bela náá, mɛkana mɛ mɛ kwyal bin ɛ́ yɛ ààdyeebadjaa. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ bi gu náá, mɔn ɛ nyɛɛg'ena Timote naazewyis tɔ membok. Nyɛ lel ɛkum wak ɔɔ, mɛ waazyɛ zɛbee bin ɛ bis nɛ nɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Swoska bɛdjɛɛdel bin djas, nɛ bot ɛ Zɛɛb djas. Bɔn nyɛɛg'enaka bot ɛ kyee dik Itali eeswos bin.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb di nɛ biyɔ djas.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
